    <string name="audio_output_bp_footer_offered">This USB device can be set to pass audio through unchanged. Android lists the formats it accepts under Mixer formats.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bp_footer_not_offered">This USB device does not offer bit-perfect output on this phone.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bp_footer_no_usb">Connect a USB audio device, such as a DAC or an audio interface, to check whether it offers bit-perfect output.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bp_footer_android_old">Bit-perfect output needs Android 14 or later.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bit_perfect_switch">Bit-perfect USB output</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bp_switch_off">Sends each song\'s samples to a USB audio device unchanged: no resampling, no volume change and no effects. Needs Android 14 and a USB device that offers it. Set the volume on the device itself.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bp_switch_waiting">On. It takes effect when a USB audio device that offers bit-perfect output is connected. Until then, music plays the normal way.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_bp_switch_active">Active. The USB device receives each song\'s samples unchanged, at the song\'s own sample rate and bit depth. The equalizer, volume normalisation, crossfade, speed, pitch and DJ tempo are off while it is active. Set the volume on the device itself. Songs in a format the device does not offer play the normal way.</string>
    <string name="playback_locked_footer">Turned off while bit-perfect USB output is active.</string>
